      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典级有两条常见路线。\n那就是“三冠路线”与“后冠路线”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea699c1e537843c46c0628b571aadc156b43f51da66c4ca883db57f9cd8fa5b3",
