    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04601e1174403911a9084b94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "老实说，如果两边都不要的话，\n会很难以抉择。我试着询问她的意愿──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed49a61d22f33062ab411f94d8f0a8bbe18fa88f34a8b780c4339c26d4b01337",
