    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69f6f84bcad84cca278260ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以不要一过新年就比赛，\n不要太匆促会比较好。\n距离也不要太长或太短。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1879e4ec9ddeef90f6452feb880cad339d8c05063da156dc80dd79f6da155184",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
