      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所有的条件都是“中间值”吗……\n那就选新年的一月与经典赛快开始的\n三月中间……",
      "source_fingerprint": "06dac863e5f63b97541cd5996eba6837274eb31715c0fd279e1e92ca8495446e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
